{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/810334-unmasqued-world","id":810334,"title":"Unmasqued World","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-16T13:22:17-08:00","id":810334,"title":"Unmasqued World","content":"Out of curiosity has anyone ever played a setting where the masquerade(be it vampire, werewolf, mage, etc.) is broken? If so how did you guys handle it and how did it go?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-16T17:36:25-08:00","id":810414,"title":"","content":"This probably does not happen too often. Most of the supernaturals in WoD have a lot to lose if they 'come out.' The vampires prey on humans, the werewolves hold to a bloody spiritual belief system beyond humanity's ken, changlings die when exposed to many modern sources of banality, ect. Without some serious in-game handwaving, most of the creatures of the night would have little interest in exposing themselves to dangers and discrimination.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3695,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","user":"The Laughing Stranger","date":". 01-17-2016, 04:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-16T22:27:25-08:00","id":810496,"title":"","content":"The reason I'm asking is because a friend of mine and I are contemplating doing one but are looking for any ideas on how best to do that. We will probably go along with a setting where because of the 21st century it just became impossible for supernaturals to go unnoticed anymore. Was just wondering if anyone has any experience with an unmasqued setting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-16T23:37:09-08:00","id":810511,"title":"","content":"As far as I know there are a few &quot;post-Gehenna&quot; settings done by random people on the web; maybe you could look at some of them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-17T00:25:29-08:00","id":810517,"title":"","content":"Laruell Hamilton's Anita Blake books has a ready made setting, to some extent. Vampires are still powerful, but Werewolves are all brawn. The first few books are pretty good, but later ones somewhat turn into a Litterotica story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5818-eviltyger","name":"EvilTyger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-17T05:13:13-08:00","id":810577,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EvilTyger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/810334-unmasqued-world?p=810517#post810517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Laruell Hamilton's Anita Blake books has a ready made setting, to some extent. Vampires are still powerful, but Werewolves are all brawn. The first few books are pretty good, but later ones somewhat turn into a Litterotica story.</div> </div> </div> </div>They started out with such promise too...Now it's all love triangles and crap. But I agree, if you look up the first few Anita books that can definitely get you a good idea. Even to the point where the government trying to pass laws where supernaturals have human rights and can't just be hunted down and murdered. Hunters would be having a hard time fighting the laws while the Kindred politicians and lobbyists try to push them through. A lot of political intrigue can be put into that sort of game, and on a national level, not just a single city.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10575-lilappleblossom","name":"lilappleblossom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"167"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-17T10:51:41-08:00","id":810684,"title":"","content":"Heard a lot of questions on this issue asking if UNIVERSAL agreements on secrecy are unnatural shouldnt SOME random idiot have decided to destroy the Veil/ masquerade a long trime ago...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-17T20:24:13-08:00","id":810940,"title":"","content":"There has been attempts but somehow they've endured so far, don't ask me how. I remember an example in VtM where some guy wrote a book detailing the Kindred, was praised as a &quot;most astounding work of fiction&quot; initially, quietly removed after a while and then they just waited for the generation that remembers the book to die off while ridding all copies they could find.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7060-karavolos","name":"Karavolos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7060_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"163"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-17T22:01:43-08:00","id":810963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karavolos</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/810334-unmasqued-world?p=810940#post810940\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There has been attempts but somehow they've endured so far, don't ask me how. I remember an example in VtM where some guy wrote a book detailing the Kindred, was praised as a &quot;most astounding work of fiction&quot; initially, quietly removed after a while and then they just waited for the generation that remembers the book to die off while ridding all copies they could find.</div> </div> </div> </div>Was that Virgil and his <i>Scarlet Letters</i>? A San Francisco-based Toreador, he was inspired by various mortal authors to try his own hand at writing. The result was a collection of <i>faux</i> letters written by a vampire to a mortal, which he self-published, trying to explain what life was like as one of the Kindred. Nearly earned himself a blood hunt.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-17T22:37:30-08:00","id":810976,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>EvilTyger</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/810334-unmasqued-world?p=810517#post810517\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Laruell Hamilton's Anita Blake books has a ready made setting, to some extent. Vampires are still powerful, but Werewolves are all brawn. The first few books are pretty good, but later ones somewhat turn into a Litterotica story.</div> </div> </div> </div>A couple of other authors have played with similar ideas:<br /> <br /> Carrie Vaughn actively explored what would happen if the Masquerade came down in her &quot;Kitty&quot; series. Catherine &quot;Kitty&quot; Norville was a late-night DJ, and relatively minor werewolf in the Denver pack. One night, though, a local vampire decides to troll her . . .and things get out of hand. Despite her best efforts to shut it down, for three hours, Kitty ends up fielding calls about possible vampire hangouts, whether there are any local werewolf packs, and how to find a reputable exorcist. The next day, her boss wants to talk to her . . . and has a simple question for her. Can she do it again?<br /> <br /> By the end of the first book, her new show - The Midnight Hour - is syndicated in every major media market in the U.S., supernaturals everywhere are calling in to the first talk show just for them, and Congress is scheduling hearings. Later books deal with the scientific conferences, the first supernatural reality tv show . . . and an ancient vampire who is <i>very</i> interested in these new developments. The focus is primarily on vampires, werewolves, and hunters - although quite a few others get cameos. <br /> <br /> A more vampire-focused series, Chloe Neil's &quot;Chicagoland Vampires&quot; kicks off about eight months after vampires announce their existence. Citing exactly the same reason the original poster mentioned, the master of House Navarre holds a press conference announcing their existence . . .<br /> <br /> The first book, <b>Some Girls Bite</b>, was probably the best . . . but the others were pretty good, too. A grad student at the University of Chicago, Catherine Merit was attacked by a rogue vampire, and only a last minute Embrace saves her life. The book shows how her friends, family, and school react to the situation . . . should be some usable ideas there.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4624-one-vorlon","name":"One Vorlon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"537"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-18T18:06:21-08:00","id":811422,"title":"","content":"I actually read the 2nd book in the 'Kitty' series. Also another series which I can't remember the name of that IIRC, dealt with different characters in each book.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5818-eviltyger","name":"EvilTyger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-21T10:42:30-08:00","id":813477,"title":"","content":"This is actually what I'm doing with my Mage Larp. Started the end times with Haqim blowing up the mountain and wrecking stuff in the middle east, so the Technocracy declares code Ragnarok and goes looking for him, but unlike Ravnos, he isn't obvious and out in the open. So they spend time and resources looking for him that is normally spend covering things up. A few too many frenzies end up on Youtube and the Masquerade and the Veil break. The EU is working up a treaty with the Cam and the Garou nation, the US has declared war on Supernaturals, Canada declared war on Vampires only (Because Trudeau is a Gurahl), Africa and Asia have always accepted the Supernatural a little more openly so nothing much changes their, The Sabbatt are much more open in south America and the Bastet there are begging for help from the other shifters, but they're busy because Cockroach fell to the worm when Pentex Corporate Father awoke. This last month the Wyld node in San Francisco erupted and the Wyld energies attracted Malkavians, CoG, CoE, Marauders, Satyrs, and Fianna which threw a big party, until Malkav awoke through the hole in reality. It was about that time that Rat said F it I'm joining the winning side and fell to the worm. Basically my plot is Apocalypse and Gehenna are happening, but not Ascension, how are the Mages going to deal with it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4915-darkuwa","name":"Darkuwa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4915_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-21T13:06:45-08:00","id":813583,"title":"","content":"I've never read the Anita Blake books but this sounds as it should and I'm liking some of the things said. Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4178-stanlemon","name":"stanlemon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"209"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-27T18:19:24-08:00","id":818113,"title":"","content":"Can't forget True Blood/The Southern Vampire Mysteries.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer, publisher, performer<br /> Mostly he/his, sometimes she/her IRL <a href=\"https://adam-lowe.com\" target=\"_blank\">https://adam-lowe.com</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5291-adambeyoncelowe","name":"adambeyoncelowe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5291_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2802"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T10:00:36-08:00","id":818538,"title":"","content":"Oh man, True Blood sucks (har har) as an example of how and why vampires should do away with the Masquerade. Synthetic blood is cheap and plentiful? Cool, you undead mockeries have still been victimizing people for the past forever, now everyone is just supposed to ignore that? The fact that the undead can now feed without hurting people means that they would no longer leave trails of corpses in their wake, and they would not have to reveal themselves to anyone. Being a vampire in secret would be quite easy, and offer no downside; no abuse, no vampire hunters, no mistrust from humans... while 'coming out' as a vampire does nothing but paint you as a target. The invention of True Blood does not provide any realistic impetus for vampires to reveal themselves, at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3695-the-laughing-stranger","name":"The Laughing Stranger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3695_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1010"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-28T15:40:41-08:00","id":818792,"title":"","content":"Mirrors for nWoD has a whole section detailing scenarios like this for their various lines. It shouldn't be too hard to use some of their ideas for oWoD.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3701-augustus-dens","name":"Augustus Dens","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3701_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"18"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-01T12:51:24-08:00","id":821144,"title":"","content":"Almost forgot, Anita Blake also had several novels put into comic form by Marvel. Including a prequel that I don't think was ever a novel or short story","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5818-eviltyger","name":"EvilTyger","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5818_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"314"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-06T16:41:20-08:00","id":825152,"title":"","content":"I'm working on a novel where there never was a masquerade. The trick is to find a way to mitigate the more anti social parts of the supernatural condition while making the supernatural very useful to those humans in power. And don't be afraid to alter history a little bit, but still have it follow the same general path.<br /> <br /> And remember, if the Victorians would have used magic for anything, it would be frivolous bull crap, though my novel is set in the 1960s, so.....<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":3932,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","user":"The young man in the cafe","date":". 02-07-2016, 11:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-02-10T13:12:54-08:00","id":827731,"title":"","content":"In my setting is like a open secret, the society knows it but most of them don't believe it or they think all vampires in western Christian countries were terminated by Inquisition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T18:33:56-07:00","id":878305,"title":"","content":"oh a curious question? Could Ghouls or kin get brought up on charges just for preserving the veil/masquerade, on the grounds that was endangering national security.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-29T20:45:53-07:00","id":878407,"title":"","content":"In the US or UK. heck yes they could. Not just them either.. Anyone who knew the truth and covered it up (cause of payoffs, threats etc) could get done for...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T05:53:27-07:00","id":878682,"title":"","content":"SAD I think would be in a very VENGEFUL mood.<br /> <br /> They've been infiltrated misled stymied, and used as a weapon.<br /> <br /> and their professionals who might feel proffessional pride being pecked at.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 04-30-2016, 08:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T08:07:29-07:00","id":878737,"title":"","content":"I also agree &quot;True Bloood&quot; is a good example about that.<br /> <br /> My own idea is &quot;low-level magic&quot; fictional world, like a mixture of &quot;Ravenloft&quot;, &quot;7th Sea&quot; and &quot;Game of Thrones&quot; but with noir-punk or atom-punk style. <br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Tell me what you brag and I will tell you what you lack&quot; (Spanish saying)<br /> <br /> \u00abThe Master Confucius said: \u201cThe noble man is in harmony but does not follow the crowd. The inferior man follows the crowd, but is not in harmony\u201d\u00bb (Anaclet 13:23)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11152-luis-carlos","name":"Luis Carlos","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"258"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T11:52:52-07:00","id":878894,"title":"","content":"I think it would be a interesting idea that before the veil goes down for everyone you could start by having an X-files-esqe story, where stuff like project twilight and FBI hunters go into full conspiracy mode to try and weaponise the night folk and keep them from public eye as long as possible and then have humaniy freak out.<br /> <br /> I believe that whatever you think of the book itself,the VtM book 'Gehenna', has some good ideas about how humans would react if the masquerade failed in the 'Crucible of God' scenario like lawyers jumping at the chance to support kindred in trials if any crimes are discovered, Religious fanatics calling for their destruction, Kindred invited onto talk shows to discuss their condition, before government's discover the horrors that the Camarilla tried to hide like death camps of kindred to feed elder's thirst.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11637-gryffon15","name":"Gryffon15","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11637_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"900"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T15:29:37-07:00","id":879047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Augustus Dens</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/810334-unmasqued-world?p=818792#post818792\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Mirrors for nWoD has a whole section detailing scenarios like this for their various lines. It shouldn't be too hard to use some of their ideas for oWoD.</div> </div> </div> </div>I agree with this. While I've never been the biggest fan of CoD/nWoD, there are books among its lines that I do recommend even for purely WoD groups because they contain useful and interesting things. Mirrors is one of them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gryffon15</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/810334-unmasqued-world?p=878894#post878894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think it would be a interesting idea that before the veil goes down for everyone you could start by having an X-files-esqe story, where stuff like project twilight and FBI hunters go into full conspiracy mode to try and weaponise the night folk and keep them from public eye as long as possible and then have humaniy freak out.<br /> <br /> I believe that whatever you think of the book itself,the VtM book 'Gehenna', has some good ideas about how humans would react if the masquerade failed in the 'Crucible of God' scenario like lawyers jumping at the chance to support kindred in trials if any crimes are discovered, Religious fanatics calling for their destruction, Kindred invited onto talk shows to discuss their condition, before government's discover the horrors that the Camarilla tried to hide like death camps of kindred to feed elder's thirst.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah <i>Gehenna</i> and the other ToJ books did have plenty of good pieces in them. The aforementioned <i>Crucible of God</i> is my favorite scenario partly because the setup which is brilliant and works wonderfully in any chronicle* but more because of how a lot of it is up to the players and focused on their survival and their struggles. The Antes are off doing their own thing and the groups not being railroaded into some greater plot, they're just trying to survive. Minus the Withering, the return of the Antes and the rest of the Gehenna-based stuff, it would make a great jumping off point for breaking the Masquerade from the Vampire PoV.<br /> <br /> Other splats are a little trickery for various reasons though I am reminded of <i>Dark Ages: Darkening Sky</i>. For those unfamiliar with it, it was an adventure book for the five Dark Ages games, with a standalone adventure for each line, all focused on an eclipse that happened at the time with all kinds of crazy events happening around it. In the Inquisitor adventure, the eclipse herald several days were the veil over the supernatural was gone and the various denizens of the World of Darkness could not hide themselves from mortals as they had.<br /> <br /> Something like that could deal with those splats that have a built-in masquerade like Werewolves and Delirium.<br /> <br /> *Though I do admit I like <i>Nightshade's</i> opening just a little more for the sheer awesomeness and WTF-ness of fighting monstrous, frenzying body of [Tzimisce] in New York City. If you're gonna end the world as we know it, go big or go home.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T17:03:03-07:00","id":879106,"title":"","content":"another idea which is creepy , is &quot;Registration&quot;<br /> <br /> which while it looks like a sensible idea on the surface, the inevitble outcome makes it a BAD IDEA.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T17:48:39-07:00","id":879130,"title":"","content":"As a starting point for homebrewing a post-Masquerade chronicle, I'd suggest putting some thought into <i><b>precisely what influence</b></i> the various supernatural factions had in whichever governments are going to be significant to the story on the day that the Masquerade broke. Some US Senators basically inherit their seat in the US Legislature from their fathers in real life, and many of them serve for decades. How many of them are blood-bound, and to whom? How many Cabinet members? For that matter, how many lobbyists? Does that influence come out in the open when the Masquerade breaks, or in the age of dark money and unaccountable SuperPACs, does trying to keep one's retainers and allies a protected secret constitute a second Masquerade?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11599,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","user":"Reasor","date":". 04-30-2016, 08:51 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11599-reasor","name":"Reasor","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-30T18:59:51-07:00","id":879163,"title":"","content":"Valid Questions<br /> (am coming down with the Fever, so please forgive my poor Grammar)<br /> Something I just thought of, those found working as agents of the supernatural, working in the police department, FBI, congress, coroners office, or whatever,<br /> <br /> To sabotage investigations, destroy evidence fake reports, etc, what could they be charged with?<br /> <br /> Just wondered because I had to note that Aldrich Ames got charged with espionage, not treason, in spite of the fact he was a US national.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":".  Fevers broken, was half blind while I posted originally. 05-01-2016, 10:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T18:20:24-07:00","id":879818,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/810334-unmasqued-world?p=879163#post879163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Valid Questions<br /> (am coming down with the Fever, so please forgiv my pooe Grammar<br /> Something I just thought of, those found wokring as agents of the supefrnatural, working in the police department, FBI, congress, coroners office, or whatever,<br /> <br /> To sabotage investigations, destroy evidencem fake reports, etc, whaT could they be charged with?<br /> <br /> Juist wondered because I had to note that Aldrich Ames got chafged with espionage, not treason, in spite of the fact he was a US national.</div> </div> </div> </div>Obstruction of various forms of law enforcement, most likely. Also probably - brace for it - conspiracy to commit crimes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T20:34:13-07:00","id":879870,"title":"","content":"thanks<br /> <br /> I could see the witch hunt that would start taking center stage... everything goes downhill<br /> <br /> Oh curious? a line from the Hunters Hunted book said that the SAD People want to weaponize kindred and presumably other supernaturals against those who arent in line with Red blooded Americans, like RPGers, back to nature people, environmentalists etc.<br /> <br /> My fevers broken now... UCK my post yesterday is a nightmare... Im going to edit it.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-01T22:38:29-07:00","id":879921,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/810334-unmasqued-world?p=879870#post879870\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">thanks<br /> <br /> I could see the witch hunt that would start taking center stage... everything goes downhill<br /> <br /> Oh curious? a line from the Hunters Hunted book said that the SAD People want to weaponize kindred and presumably other supernaturals against those who arent in line with Red blooded Americans, like RPGers, back to nature people, environmentalists etc.<br /> <br /> My fevers broken now... UCK my post yesterday is a nightmare... Im going to edit it.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, in the new Hunter's Hunted for V20, it noted that pretty much no one who worked at SAD as presented in Project Twilight is still posted there. That's something that would definitely shift their agendas around. Overly-ambitious aims like &quot;try to make a unit of monsters to fight threats to US sovereignty&quot; would get buried in the shuffle and transfers. If anyone is trying to do that, it would probably be extremely local.<br /> <br /> (Also, a fair number of tabletop players seem to be in line with the Minutemen faction from PT, so even as a kind of self-depricating joke, including.them in that role isn't entirely true.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T00:57:32-07:00","id":879967,"title":"","content":"Another thing to consider.. What would they do with people like shifter kinfolk, or a vamp's retainers/ghouls?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-02T04:39:10-07:00","id":880047,"title":"","content":"I could see the government (or a lynch mob) Targeting them as a weak link ...<br /> <br /> happyiest scenariao is the garou standing triumphant over a pile of corpses, forcing the government to submit to a Geas or such to safeguard them, possible with a uketena elder or two taking a lock of hair, to be on the safe side. so they can &quot;Remote kill&quot; the officials if they ever find it neccessary<br /> <br /> happyiest scenariao... not that likely to happen.<br /> <br /> oh could just KNOWLEDGE of the existence of the supernatural and not coming forward with it, potentialy be enough to face &quot;Endangering natoinal safety charges&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1153,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","user":"Prince of the Night","date":". 05-02-2016, 08:43 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join D